BT 1 0 0 1 0 46.5 Tm /F2 9.5 Tf 14 TL .860806 Tw (The Jura is the wine world's most productive misfit. Tucked into a narrow strip of limestone between Burgundy and) Tj T* 0 Tw .838714 Tw (Switzerland, it makes wines that follow no one else's logic and sees no reason to start. The concept that defines it is) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.00225 Tw (eccentricity \227 not as affectation but as the natural consequence of a culture that developed in relative isolation and) Tj T* 0 Tw (found its own solutions to every question that winemaking poses.) Tj T* ET
