BT 1 0 0 1 0 74.5 Tm /F2 9.5 Tf 14 TL .1005 Tw (The region faces inward with an intensity that borders on obliviousness. The Jura is aware that the outside world exists,) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.930611 Tw (but it regards the outside world's opinions with the polite indifference of someone who has been doing things a) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.077 Tw (particular way for centuries and sees no compelling reason to change. The winemaker here is an eccentric in the original) Tj T* 0 Tw .563825 Tw (sense of the word \227 off-centre, following an orbit that does not align with anyone else's. This is not rebellion, which) Tj T* 0 Tw .3325 Tw (implies awareness of a norm that one is defying. It is something more fundamental: a genuine inability to see why one) Tj T* 0 Tw (would do things any other way.) Tj T* ET
