BT 1 0 0 1 0 46.5 Tm /F2 9.5 Tf 14 TL 1.075281 Tw (What makes the Jura distinctive is the authenticity of its strangeness. Other regions cultivate unconventionality as a) Tj T* 0 Tw .6425 Tw (marketing strategy. The Jura is unconventional because it has never occurred to it to be anything else. Without it, the) Tj T* 0 Tw .2926 Tw (world of wine would lose its most convincing proof that the most original things are often those that were never trying) Tj T* 0 Tw (to be original \227 that true eccentricity cannot be manufactured.) Tj T* ET
