BT 1 0 0 1 0 46.5 Tm /F2 9.5 Tf 14 TL .076528 Tw (The Loire is the most emotionally generous wine region in France. Stretching from the Atlantic marshes to the volcanic) Tj T* 0 Tw .0418 Tw (hills of the Massif Central, it encompasses a diversity of styles that would seem incoherent in any region less unified by) Tj T* 0 Tw .193167 Tw (temperament. The concept that defines it is sentimentality \227 not as weakness or superficiality but as the willingness to) Tj T* 0 Tw (feel openly, to value emotional truth over intellectual rigour, and to trust that the heart is as reliable a guide as the mind.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 78 240 cm
q
.172549 .141176 .12549 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 46.5 Tm /F2 9.5 Tf 14 TL -0.086028 Tw (The region faces the world with an openness that distinguishes it from the introversion of Burgundy and the institutional) Tj T* 0 Tw .431412 Tw (formality of Bordeaux. The Loire's winemakers tend to be accessible, idealistic, and deeply committed to the idea that) Tj T* 0 Tw .284472 Tw (wine should be part of daily life rather than reserved for occasions of special significance. The natural wine movement) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.080433 Tw (found fertile ground here precisely because the culture already valued sincerity over polish, authenticity over perfection.) Tj T* 0 Tw ET
