q
.172549 .141176 .12549 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 60.5 Tm /F2 9.5 Tf 14 TL .858167 Tw (Time in the Loire operates as a gentle current rather than a fixed position. The region neither clings to the past with) Tj T* 0 Tw .120531 Tw (Burgundian devotion nor races toward the future with New World urgency. It flows, adapting without anxiety, carrying) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.397556 Tw (forward what works and releasing what does not. The winemaker here is a romantic in the philosophical sense \227) Tj T* 0 Tw .483941 Tw (someone who believes in the primacy of feeling, who trusts intuition alongside analysis, and who sees winemaking as) Tj T* 0 Tw (an expressive act rather than a technical one.) Tj T* ET
Q
