.172549 .141176 .12549 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 46.5 Tm /F2 9.5 Tf 14 TL .690861 Tw (What makes the Loire distinctive is the breadth of emotion it encompasses within a single cultural identity. From the) Tj T* 0 Tw .781111 Tw (contemplative stillness of its greatest sweet wines to the vivid exuberance of its everyday reds, the register is always) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.1405 Tw (emotional, always personal. Without it, France would lose not just a wine region but a sensibility \227 the proof that) Tj T* 0 Tw (tenderness and seriousness are not incompatible.) Tj T* ET
