BT 1 0 0 1 0 46.5 Tm /F2 9.5 Tf 14 TL 1.5725 Tw (The Northern Rh\364ne is a region of magnificent isolation. A single grape, grown on slopes so steep that the word) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.10165 Tw (vineyard barely applies, by producers so few that the entire appellation could fit in a single village hall. The concept that) Tj T* 0 Tw .0725 Tw (defines it is solitude \227 not loneliness, which implies a desire for company, but the self-sufficient aloneness of a culture) Tj T* 0 Tw (that has found everything it needs within its own narrow corridor.) Tj T* ET
Q
