q
.172549 .141176 .12549 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 46.5 Tm /F2 9.5 Tf 14 TL 1.772029 Tw (What makes the Northern Rh\364ne distinctive is the purity of its commitment to the singular. Where other regions) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.074687 Tw (diversify, it narrows. Where others build institutions, it relies on individuals. Where others seek connection, it finds) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.041088 Tw (sufficiency in solitude. Without it, the world of wine would lose its most uncompromising example of the monastic) Tj T* 0 Tw (tradition \227 the proof that the deepest expression requires the most complete withdrawal.) Tj T* ET
