BT 1 0 0 1 0 46.5 Tm /F2 9.5 Tf 14 TL .229357 Tw (Provence is a region that has made pleasure its philosophy and refuses to apologise for it. The concept that defines it is) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.16375 Tw (pleasure \227 not the complex, earned pleasure of a wine that reveals itself over decades, but the immediate, sensory) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.01935 Tw (pleasure of a glass that asks nothing of the drinker except willingness to enjoy. In a wine world that often confuses) Tj T* 0 Tw (difficulty with depth, Provence insists that ease is its own form of mastery.) Tj T* ET
