.172549 .141176 .12549 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 46.5 Tm /F2 9.5 Tf 14 TL 1.164278 Tw (The region faces outward with the confidence of a place whose appeal is self-evident. The landscape, the light, the) Tj T* 0 Tw .255 Tw (cuisine, and the culture of leisure that surrounds the wine \227 everything conspires to create an experience that does not) Tj T* 0 Tw .69065 Tw (need to be explained or justified. The winemaker here is a curator of pleasure, someone whose art consists not in the) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.027941 Tw (creation of challenging complexity but in the elimination of everything that stands between the drinker and the moment.) Tj T* 0 Tw ET
