.172549 .141176 .12549 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 46.5 Tm /F2 9.5 Tf 14 TL 2.117382 Tw (Time in Provence operates as an eternal present. The culture does not face backward toward tradition with any) Tj T* 0 Tw .155562 Tw (particular intensity, nor forward toward innovation with any particular urgency. It faces outward toward the terrace, the) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.102528 Tw (table, and the afternoon. History is present \227 the Roman foundations, the medieval monasteries \227 but it serves as) Tj T* 0 Tw (backdrop rather than burden, enriching the present moment without demanding attention for itself.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
