BT 1 0 0 1 0 46.5 Tm /F2 9.5 Tf 14 TL 1.230725 Tw (The Nahe is the region that whispers when everyone else is speaking at full volume. The concept that defines it is) Tj T* 0 Tw .6878 Tw (subtlety \227 the ability to communicate something profound through means so understated that only attentive listeners) Tj T* 0 Tw .042275 Tw (register it. In a country where the Mosel claims poetry and the Rheingau claims nobility, the Nahe claims nothing at all,) Tj T* 0 Tw (and in that refusal to claim lies its particular power.) Tj T* ET
