BT 1 0 0 1 0 46.5 Tm /F2 9.5 Tf 14 TL .2147 Tw (The Santa Cruz Mountains is a region that exists because a handful of individuals cared about it more than anyone else) Tj T* 0 Tw .363 Tw (thought reasonable. The concept that defines it is obsession \227 the quality of commitment so intense that it crosses the) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.5352 Tw (line from dedication into something more extreme, more personal, and more productive than ordinary passion can) Tj T* 0 Tw (sustain.) Tj T* ET
