BT 1 0 0 1 0 74.5 Tm /F2 9.5 Tf 14 TL .855 Tw (The region faces inward with the self-absorption of people who are pursuing a private vision and do not particularly) Tj T* 0 Tw .828176 Tw (care whether the world follows. The mountain terrain is spectacularly difficult \227 fog, forest, poor access roads, tiny) Tj T* 0 Tw .017575 Tw (clearings where a few rows of vines cling to slopes that are better suited to redwoods. Everything about the enterprise is) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.448433 Tw (impractical, uneconomical, and completely deliberate. The winemaker here is an obsessive in the clinical sense \227) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.029833 Tw (someone whose fixation on a particular piece of ground produces work of extraordinary quality at extraordinary) Tj T* 0 Tw (personal cost.) Tj T* ET
