BT 1 0 0 1 0 46.5 Tm /F2 9.5 Tf 14 TL .0045 Tw (Time in the Santa Cruz Mountains operates as private history. Each producer carries their own timeline \227 the year they) Tj T* 0 Tw .590583 Tw (first tasted what this mountain could produce, the seasons of failure that preceded the vintages of revelation, the slow) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.161111 Tw (accumulation of understanding that only comes from years of intimate attention to a single site. The culture has no) Tj T* 0 Tw (shared mythology because each practitioner's relationship with the mountain is too personal to generalise.) Tj T* ET
