BT 1 0 0 1 0 46.5 Tm /F2 9.5 Tf 14 TL .811194 Tw (Sonoma is the region that Napa might have been if ambition had been tempered by self-awareness. The concept that) Tj T* 0 Tw .742425 Tw (defines it is authenticity \227 the quality of being genuinely what you are rather than performing a version of what the) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.162654 Tw (market expects. Where Napa projects ambition and commands attention, Sonoma produces comparable quality with) Tj T* 0 Tw (considerably less theatre, and considers this restraint a virtue.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 78 508 cm
q
.172549 .141176 .12549 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 60.5 Tm /F2 9.5 Tf 14 TL 1.185125 Tw (The region faces outward with a deliberate informality that masks serious intent. The farmer's market aesthetic, the) Tj T* 0 Tw .934912 Tw (unpretentious tasting rooms, the winemakers in work boots \227 these are not marketing strategies but reflections of a) Tj T* 0 Tw .944656 Tw (culture that genuinely values substance over style. The winemaker in Sonoma is a craftsperson who has consciously) Tj T* 0 Tw .005029 Tw (rejected the celebrity model, someone whose satisfaction comes from the quality of the work rather than the recognition) Tj T* 0 Tw (it generates.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 78 446 cm
q
.172549 .141176 .12549 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 46.5 Tm /F2 9.5 Tf 14 TL .268794 Tw (Time in Sonoma operates as parallel history. The region developed alongside Napa, sharing the same founding era and) Tj T* 0 Tw .424147 Tw (many of the same varieties, but followed a different trajectory \227 less capital, less concentration, more diversity, more) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.039458 Tw (experimentation. This parallel development provides a natural control experiment: same conditions, different values,) Tj T* 0 Tw (and the resulting wines serve as evidence that the culture surrounding production matters as much as the land itself.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 78 370 cm
q
.172549 .141176 .12549 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 60.5 Tm /F2 9.5 Tf 14 TL .303568 Tw (What makes Sonoma distinctive is the coherence of its alternative vision. It is not a lesser Napa or a casual Napa but a) Tj T* 0 Tw .239 Tw (fundamentally different proposition \227 a region that has defined quality on its own terms and built a culture around the) Tj T* 0 Tw .5165 Tw (belief that the best wines do not need to announce themselves. Without it, California would lose its conscience \227 the) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.490233 Tw (quiet voice that reminds the state's wine industry that ambition without authenticity produces spectacle rather than) Tj T* 0 Tw (meaning.) Tj T* ET
