.172549 .141176 .12549 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 60.5 Tm /F2 9.5 Tf 14 TL .587 Tw (Walla Walla is a wine region built on the principle that neighbours matter more than competition. In a country where) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.077571 Tw (viticultural ambition often expresses itself through individual brands and singular personal visions, Walla Walla has) Tj T* 0 Tw .122972 Tw (constructed something genuinely rare: a culture where the success of the collective is treated as the precondition for the) Tj T* 0 Tw .1596 Tw (success of any individual within it. The concept that defines it is community \227 not as sentimentality but as strategy, as) Tj T* 0 Tw (a deliberate choice about how a wine region should organise itself from the ground up.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 78 192 cm
q
.172549 .141176 .12549 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 46.5 Tm /F2 9.5 Tf 14 TL 1.115722 Tw (The region is young enough that its founders are still present, still pouring, still sharing equipment and advice with) Tj T* 0 Tw .392294 Tw (newcomers. This proximity to origins gives the culture an informality that older regions cannot replicate. There are no) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.730781 Tw (dynasties here, no inherited hierarchies, no centuries of accumulated grievance. The winemaker's role is that of a) Tj T* 0 Tw (participant in a shared project \227 someone whose reputation is inseparable from the reputation of the place itself.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 78 130 cm
q
.172549 .141176 .12549 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 46.5 Tm /F2 9.5 Tf 14 TL 1.0045 Tw (Time operates in Walla Walla as possibility rather than burden. The absence of a long history is experienced not as) Tj T* 0 Tw .752083 Tw (deficit but as freedom \227 freedom to define what the region means without the weight of inherited expectations. The) Tj T* 0 Tw .437 Tw (orientation is simultaneously inward and outward: inward in the sense of deep investment in local identity, outward in) Tj T* 0 Tw (the willingness to welcome outsiders, share knowledge, and build institutions that serve the whole rather than the few.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 78 68 cm
q
.172549 .141176 .12549 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 46.5 Tm /F2 9.5 Tf 14 TL .426233 Tw (What makes Walla Walla distinctive is this structural generosity. Other young regions compete internally for attention) Tj T* 0 Tw .562083 Tw (and resources. Walla Walla cooperates, and in doing so demonstrates that a wine culture can be built from fellowship) Tj T* 0 Tw .873441 Tw (rather than rivalry. Its loss would remove the most persuasive contemporary example that community itself can be a) Tj T* 0 Tw (wine region's defining and organising characteristic.) Tj T* ET
