.172549 .141176 .12549 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 46.5 Tm /F2 9.5 Tf 14 TL 1.059929 Tw (The Willamette Valley is a region founded on a bet against the odds and a refusal to be practical. The concept that) Tj T* 0 Tw .209528 Tw (defines it is idealism \227 the belief, held against considerable evidence, that this cool, rainy, unfashionable corner of the) Tj T* 0 Tw .020781 Tw (Pacific Northwest could produce wines not just adequate but transcendent, wines that belonged in conversation with the) Tj T* 0 Tw (greatest examples from anywhere in the world.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 78 548 cm
q
.172549 .141176 .12549 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 60.5 Tm /F2 9.5 Tf 14 TL 1.650765 Tw (The region faces outward with the earnest intensity of true believers. The founding generation did not come here) Tj T* 0 Tw .519531 Tw (because the market demanded Oregon wines or because the economics made sense. They came because they believed) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.234548 Tw (the land had something to say, and they were willing to spend their careers \227 and in many cases their savings \227) Tj T* 0 Tw .0575 Tw (listening. The winemaker in the Willamette Valley is an idealist in the original sense: someone motivated by a vision of) Tj T* 0 Tw (what could be rather than a calculation of what will sell.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 78 472 cm
q
.172549 .141176 .12549 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 60.5 Tm /F2 9.5 Tf 14 TL .562083 Tw (Time in the Willamette operates as vindication in slow motion. The early decades were lean \227 critics were sceptical,) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.501 Tw (consumers were indifferent, and the climate delivered as many heartbreaking vintages as triumphant ones. But the) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.308889 Tw (idealists held, and the accumulation of great vintages over the past two decades has begun to transform belief into) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.438194 Tw (evidence. The culture is transitioning from faith to knowledge, and this transition \227 still incomplete \227 gives it a) Tj T* 0 Tw (poignancy that fully established regions no longer possess.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 78 410 cm
q
.172549 .141176 .12549 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 46.5 Tm /F2 9.5 Tf 14 TL .561618 Tw (What makes the Willamette Valley distinctive is the purity of its founding motivation. Other regions were planted for) Tj T* 0 Tw .181767 Tw (commercial reasons and discovered idealism later. The Willamette was planted for idealistic reasons and is discovering) Tj T* 0 Tw .670029 Tw (commerce now. Without it, the world of wine would lose its most moving demonstration that conviction can precede) Tj T* 0 Tw (evidence \227 that sometimes you must believe in a place before the place has given you any reason to.) Tj T* ET
Q
